---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — lean-ctx">
  <section class="privacy-section">
    <div class="content-grid">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>

      <h2>Zero Telemetry</h2>
      <p>lean-ctx collects no data. Zero analytics, zero crash reports, zero usage tracking. The binary makes no network requests. Everything runs 100% locally on your machine.</p>

      <h2>What lean-ctx accesses</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Files in your project directory (read-only, within PathJail sandbox)</li>
        <li>Shell command output (only commands your AI agent runs)</li>
        <li>Local session storage (~/.local/share/lean-ctx/)</li>
        <li>Local configuration (~/.config/lean-ctx/)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What lean-ctx never does</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Send data to any server</li>
        <li>Phone home for updates</li>
        <li>Collect usage metrics</li>
        <li>Access files outside the project directory</li>
        <li>Store credentials or secrets</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Website</h2>
      <p>This website (leanctx.com) is a static site. It does not use cookies for tracking. The search feature (Pagefind) runs entirely client-side.</p>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>
      <p>lean-ctx is fully open source under MIT + Apache-2.0 dual license. You can audit every line of code at <a href="https://github.com/yvgude/lean-ctx">github.com/yvgude/lean-ctx</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-section {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .privacy-section h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-bright);
  }
  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-bright);
  }
  .privacy-section p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-section li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .privacy-section a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .privacy-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
